k. 5. Injected policy boundary runs cover message, in-flight, queued, aggregate-byte, and deadline admission; repeated runs reconcile runtime, packet, TCP, DNS, connection-epoch, promotion, route, and drop counters and return tasks, buffers, channels, and cache state to baseline.\")'" in /Users/iv/Developer/relux-tunnel
